---
import "@fontsource/cormorant-garamond/latin-400.css";
import "@fontsource/cormorant-garamond/latin-400-italic.css";
import "@fontsource/cormorant-garamond/latin-600.css";
import "@fontsource/dm-mono/latin-400.css";
import "../styles/studio.css";
import { pressing, works, site } from "../data";
export interface Props {}
const description = "A small archive of deliberate editions by Mazze LeCzzare. Prepared locally, checked before publication, and sealed as exact bytes with Rustpress.";
const totalBytes = works.reduce((total, entry) => total + entry.bytes, 0);
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f3eee3" />
    <title>Rustpress · The pressing room · Mazze LeCzzare</title>
    <meta name="description" content={description} />
    <link rel="canonical" href={`${site}/`} />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Rustpress · The pressing room" />
    <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
    <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
    <meta property="og:url" content={`${site}/`} />
    <meta property="og:site_name" content="Rustpress" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header class="masthead">
      <a class="wordmark" href="/" aria-label="Rustpress home"><span class="wordmark-symbol" aria-hidden="true">rp.</span><span>Rustpress<small>The pressing room / Mazze LeCzzare</small></span></a>
      <nav aria-label="Main navigation"><a href="#editions">Editions</a><a href="#colophon">The process</a><a href="https://github.com/mazze93/rustpress">Source <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></nav>
    </header>
    <main id="main" tabindex="-1">
      <section class="opening" aria-labelledby="title">
        <div class="title-block">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="registration" aria-hidden="true"></span>Independent works. Deliberate editions.</p>
          <h1 id="title">A work becomes<br /><em>an edition.</em></h1>
          <p class="lede">Not everything on the bench belongs in the world. This is the part that was ready to leave it.</p>
          <a class="button-link" href="#editions">Explore the pressing <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
        <aside class="impression" aria-label="Current pressing">
          <div class="impression-top"><span>Rustpress / Edition record</span><span aria-hidden="true">01</span></div>
          <div class="press-mark" aria-hidden="true">rp<span>.</span></div>
          <p class="impression-motto">Prepared. Checked.<br /><em>Pressed.</em></p>
          <div class="impression-bottom"><span>Current pressing</span><strong>{pressing.release}</strong><span>{works.length} {works.length === 1 ? "work" : "works"} · {totalBytes.toLocaleString("en-US")} bytes of writing</span></div>
        </aside>
        <div class="opening-foot"><span>A working archive, not a feed.</span><a href="/pressing.json">View edition manifest <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
      </section>
      <section class="editions" id="editions" aria-labelledby="editions-title">
        <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">01 / On the shelf</p><h2 id="editions-title">The current pressing</h2></div><span class="count">{String(works.length).padStart(2, "0")} {works.length === 1 ? "work" : "works"}</span></div>
        <div class="edition-list">
          {works.map((entry, index) => (
            <article class="edition">
              <span class="edition-number" aria-hidden="true">{String(index + 1).padStart(2, "0")}</span>
              <div class="edition-body">
                <p class="eyebrow">{entry.date ? <time datetime={entry.date}>{entry.date}</time> : "Undated"} / Static edition</p>
                <h3><a href={entry.url}>{entry.title || "Untitled edition"}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></h3>
                <p>{entry.description || "A reviewed work, preserved in this pressing."}</p>
                <div class="edition-proof"><span>{entry.bytes.toLocaleString("en-US")} bytes</span><details><summary>Inspect fingerprint</summary><p class="proof-label">SHA-256 / Sealed file</p><code>{entry.sha256}</code><p>Identifies the sealed file. Delivery services can transform the HTTP response; this hash does not establish authorship or truth.</p></details></div>
              </div>
            </article>
          ))}
          {works.length === 0 && <p class="empty-state">This pressing contains no editions yet. The manifest records what is included.</p>}
        </div>
      </section>
      <section class="colophon" id="colophon" aria-labelledby="colophon-title">
        <div class="colophon-intro"><p class="eyebrow">02 / Behind the impression</p><h2 id="colophon-title">Prepared once.<br /><em>Published as it stood.</em></h2><p>A pressing records the work at a particular moment. A revision receives a new name. The sealed edition stays as it was.</p><a class="text-link" href="https://github.com/mazze93/rustpress">See how Rustpress works <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div>
        <ol class="process-list">
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><div><h3>Prepare</h3><p>Select the work. Check local links and media. Build the static site.</p></div></li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><div><h3>Verify</h3><p>Seal the file inventory and hashes. Review the complete publication before it leaves the bench.</p></div></li>
          <li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><div><h3>Publish</h3><p>Upload the sealed output, without rebuilding. The reviewed files are the deployment payload.</p></div></li>
        </ol>
        <details class="release-proof"><summary>Inside this pressing <span>{pressing.release}</span></summary><dl class="ledger"><div><dt>Edition</dt><dd>{pressing.release}</dd></div><div><dt>Publication boundary</dt><dd>Static HTML & local media</dd></div><div><dt>Source fingerprint</dt><dd><code>{pressing.source_tree_sha256}</code></dd></div><div><dt>What the hash means</dt><dd>Byte identity, not authorship or truth. The source fingerprint is distinct from the release seal.</dd></div></dl><a class="text-link" href="/pressing.json">Open the public manifest <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></details>
      </section>
      <section class="return-note" aria-label="More from the author"><p>Before the pressing,<br /><em>there is the work.</em></p><a class="text-link" href="https://mazzeleczzare.com/">Explore Mazze’s work <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></section>
    </main>
    <footer><span>Rustpress / Mazze LeCzzare</span><span>Local preparation. Explicit publication.</span><a href="https://github.com/mazze93/rustpress">Built in the open <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></footer>
  </body>
</html>
